        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d51735bd-6bf2-37b9-8caf-cf00a26abf6f",
                "word": "collabo",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "78b967e8-32e0-4e50-b2a7-0d36a2b51eb8",
                        "entry_id": "d51735bd-6bf2-37b9-8caf-cf00a26abf6f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "collabos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fda2444b-56fd-3ac2-bfe5-b30ce5f5cf7f",
                        "entry_id": "d51735bd-6bf2-37b9-8caf-cf00a26abf6f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie les actes d'un tel personnage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a80847c-b1dd-41d8-9a29-b2b84b470753",
                                "sense_id": "fda2444b-56fd-3ac2-bfe5-b30ce5f5cf7f",
                                "text": "Comme tous les gens connus, la presse collabo de Paris l'a injurié, bafoué, traîné plus bas que terre avec ce raffinement dans l'insulte infâme que donne la garantie de l’impunité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5222f464-df38-4f42-baa5-5ecd716e026b",
                                "sense_id": "fda2444b-56fd-3ac2-bfe5-b30ce5f5cf7f",
                                "text": "Otto Abetz et la Propaganda-Abteilung sont les pourvoyeurs et les manipulateurs de ce monde de la presse collabo. D'abord elle doit être populaire."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99a8213d-b5ed-4280-bd2c-143ca301914d",
                        "source_entry_id": "d51735bd-6bf2-37b9-8caf-cf00a26abf6f",
                        "source_sense_id": "fda2444b-56fd-3ac2-bfe5-b30ce5f5cf7f",
                        "target_lang_word": "quisling",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quisling",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0752f64-8097-3506-b242-56c875bc5b8b",
                                        "entry_id": "aed9f724-9512-3911-b77e-08c8c7ea2434",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A traitor who collaborates with the enemy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5be1294f-a0d1-4730-a4cd-99334069cc65",
                                                "sense_id": "e0752f64-8097-3506-b242-56c875bc5b8b",
                                                "text": "In many countries, including some where the Jews were neither numerically strong nor in possession of important posts, these envoys of the German Secret Service have been able, solely by the use of anti-Jewish slogans, to create those \"national\" Fascist movements from which Quislings are bred."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e11a6396-2cdd-4d7a-9815-ab7285e08c8c",
                                                "sense_id": "e0752f64-8097-3506-b242-56c875bc5b8b",
                                                "text": "If, in the nation about to be attacked, influential persons were discovered who could be bribed or corrupted, German agents made use of these quislings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0cb2b67-f72b-443a-80b4-d5f2591f9e7e",
                                                "sense_id": "e0752f64-8097-3506-b242-56c875bc5b8b",
                                                "text": "It is time to clear out the quislings and paid flunkies of city hall and big business."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dfdab71-8600-459b-a827-1615656e5b14",
                                                "sense_id": "e0752f64-8097-3506-b242-56c875bc5b8b",
                                                "text": "The man she cherishes, the man she butterfly-kisses, the man she sleeps curved around like two spoons in a drawer. It is he who is evil, he who is sworn to destroy her, an emotional quisling of the first water."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4846d99d-6e1e-4bc3-bcdf-2364306de7c3",
                                                "sense_id": "e0752f64-8097-3506-b242-56c875bc5b8b",
                                                "text": "He sees off an attack from humans, who have as servants certain quisling apes, former followers of Caesar’s traitorous ex-comrade Koba (a motion-capture performance from Toby Kebbell)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "quisling",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68f255ae-eb4e-3a99-beaa-3dd7f5c54491",
                                        "entry_id": "37ba29b1-cfae-32e0-af0e-35ead3b73bfc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of quisle"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "65cb7bd3-9af7-3c5a-95e9-c54f869673db",
                "word": "collabo",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ead8869b-d96c-4466-a9ed-7ba38ee0094d",
                        "entry_id": "65cb7bd3-9af7-3c5a-95e9-c54f869673db",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "collabos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "11fc95e8-dfd2-31ed-bdb1-7b2e6be4ca91",
                        "entry_id": "65cb7bd3-9af7-3c5a-95e9-c54f869673db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Collaborateur, collaboratrice."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "834fb8e1-51c2-40fa-b0ae-c2ddab4e0af3",
                                "sense_id": "11fc95e8-dfd2-31ed-bdb1-7b2e6be4ca91",
                                "text": "— Non ! et ce n’est pas moi qui ai écrit cette phrase si chaude. Je l’ai lue un matin dans l’article d’un collabo. Je l’ai trouvée raide, mais je n’allais pas faire un erratum, sûr !"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2a02d624-8755-3fce-b5c0-e44e4eb02d69",
                        "entry_id": "65cb7bd3-9af7-3c5a-95e9-c54f869673db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne ayant collaboré, par toutes les formes possibles, avec l'ennemi de sa patrie en temps de guerre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23ca3c7e-7aaf-4a37-8ddb-90eb9421dddd",
                                "sense_id": "2a02d624-8755-3fce-b5c0-e44e4eb02d69",
                                "text": "Le fait que Brasillach, lui-même ancien khâgneux de Louis-le-Grand, ait étudié sur les bancs mêmes où nous étions assis l’emportait absolument sur les appels abominables au meurtre des Juifs proférés par l’écrivain collabo dans Je suis partout et d’autres feuilles à la solde des nazis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30b08077-2ed2-4605-a5de-15312276c5ce",
                                "sense_id": "2a02d624-8755-3fce-b5c0-e44e4eb02d69",
                                "text": "De 1940 à 1944, Céline entretient des relations plus ou moins régulières avec les antisémites et les « collabos » de tout poil comme Henri Coston, Louis Darquier de Pellepoix, Marcel Déat, Jean Luchaire, George Montandon, Lucien Rebatet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea4ed61d-b763-41a5-8897-e06552283db1",
                                "sense_id": "2a02d624-8755-3fce-b5c0-e44e4eb02d69",
                                "text": "On y affirmait aussi qu’environ 1000 SS et collabos originaires des États baltes (Lettonie, Estonie, Lithuanie) s’étaient installés au Canada."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
